in Dungeon Season 2","subtitle":"2027","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx178031-XNWYP6Qf18bB.png","backdropUrl":null,"overview":"The second season of Dungeon Meshi.","kind":"anime","rating":null,"certification":null,"runtime":null},{"id":"cmri3n8mwfb8cns755j6nohn8","title":"Bocchi the Rock! 2nd Season","subtitle":"anime","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx186712-d5I2TjUQcHuI.jpg","backdropUrl":null,"overview":"We will Be back！\n\nThe second season of Bocchi the Rock!\n\n(Source: Official BTR Twitter)","kind":"anime","rating":null,"certification":null,"runtime":null},{"id":"cmri0pzwqbuc1ns755w3sqwc8","title":"Chainsaw Man – The Movie: Reze Arc","subtitle":"2025","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx171627-ZN9D7P46yHnw.png","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/171627-7esVHhgw69rn.jpg","overview":"Theatrical follow-up to Chainsaw Man.\nDenji became “Chainsaw Man”, a boy with a devil’s heart, and is now part of Special Division 4’s devil hunters. After a date with Makima, the woman of his dreams, Denji takes shelter from the rain. There he meets Reze, a girl who works in a café.\n\n(Source: MAPPA CHANNEL)","kind":"anime","rating":9,"certification":null,"runtime":100},{"id":"cmrg97iyf07ouk9352mj7193m","title":"Mob Psycho 100 II","subtitle":"2019","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101338-rokVscjRYzdP.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101338-Rl54Qhx71dUq.jpg","overview":"The second season of Mob Psycho 100. \nKageyama is an ordinary 8th grader who just wants to live a normal life. Although he can disappear in the crowd in a flash, he was actually the most powerful psychic. The lives of those around Mob and his numerous feelings that softly piles up for the eventual explosion. The mysterious group \"Claw\" stands before him once again. In the midst of his youthful days, where will his roaring heart take him!?\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","kind":"anime","rating":8.7,"certification":null,"runtime":24},{"id":"cmri0n51sbqx0ns75t8xo20mb","title":"Mob Psycho 100 III","subtitle":"2022","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx140439-bPKmhe1wNxc9.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/140439-r9SRh0q0UgX1.jpg","overview":"The third season of Mob Psycho 100. \nThe appearance of a divine tree and new religion turns Mob and Reigen's city upside down!\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","kind":"anime","rating":8.7,"certification":null,"runtime":24},{"id":"cmri0r7fubvpbns75yr58zf7k","title":"Violet Evergarden: the Movie","subtitle":"2020","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx103047-odblDHHEdehK.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/103047-Tjvsh5w1XZP4.jpg","overview":"While writing other people’s emotions, she may have neglected her own. Violet Evergarden, the child soldier turned Auto Memory Doll, writes letters that evoke the words her clients can’t. But when a terminally ill boy requests her services for his family, her own feelings about love and loss resurface. Now she must confront her past and the death of the Major.\n\n(Source: Funimation)","kind":"anime","rating":8.7,"certification":null,"runtime":140},{"id":"cmri0xgcbc2gens75wtrm4y5d","title":"Kizumonogatari Part 3: Reiketsu","subtitle":"2017","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21400-38ykNo3j4xXo.png","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21400-5zcYUeVBptdG.jpg","overview":"First season of the Monogatari Series, part 4/6. Contains the arc Koyomi Vamp from the Kizumonogatari light novel.\n\nWith help from Meme Oshino, the apparition specialist, Koyomi defeats the three powerful vampire hunters: Dramaturgy, Episode and Guillotinecutter. Koyomi takes back all the limbs of Kiss-Shot Acerola-Orion Heart-Under-Blade in order to become a human again. But, when he returns to Kiss-Shot, she reveals to him the cold truth of what it means to be a vampire—a creature of the night. Unable to take back what he has done, Koyomi feels nothing but regret and can only deny his dreadful fate. While Koyomi is struggling to face reality, his “friend” Tsubasa Hanekawa comes to him with a certain plan…\n\n(Source: Aniplex)","kind":"anime","rating":8.7,"certification":null,"runtime":82},{"id":"cmri325o2enoyns75omlt31b3","title":"Gintama: The Final Chapter - Be Forever Yorozuya","subtitle":"2013","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx15335-QjijwChGTBs0.png","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/15335-uARkRgyx8adp.jpg","overview":"When Gintoki apprehends a movie pirate at a premiere, he checks the camera's footage and finds himself transported to a bleak, post-apocalyptic version of Edo, where a mysterious epidemic called the \"White Plague\" has ravished the world's population. It turns out that the movie pirate wasn't a pirate after all—it was an android time machine, and Gintoki has been hurtled five years into the future! Shinpachi and Kagura, his Yorozuya cohorts, have had a falling out and are now battle-hardened solo vigilantes and he himself has been missing for years, disappearing without a trace after scribbling a strange message in his journal.\n\nSetting out in the disguise given to him by the android time machine, Gintoki haphazardly reunites the Yorozuya team to investigate the White Plague, and soon discovers that the key to saving the future lies in the darkness of his own past. Determined to confront a powerful foe, he makes an important discovery—with a ragtag band of friends and allies at his side, he doesn't have to fight alone.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","kind":"anime","rating":8.7,"certification":null,"runtime":110},{"id":"cmri3qtjwffaens75i2rg8kd5","title":"Sound! Euphonium 3","subtitle":"2024","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx109731-EwHzbtywdcyG.png","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/109731-O9wpjWphEhKn.jpg","overview":"The third season of Hibike! Euphonium.\n\nKumiko's third year finally begins! With the concert band at Kitauji High School over 90 members, Kumiko is now the president and does her best with her final high school club activities to try to win her long-desired gold at nationals.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)","kind":"anime","rating":8.7,"certification":null,"runtime":25},{"id":"cmrg979ml06skk935zcw94hw8","title":"JUJUTSU KAISEN Season 2","subtitle":"2023","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx145064-hSNRJM03pvv1.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/145064-esDtAY2He7sk.jpg","overview":"The second season of Jujutsu Kaisen.\n\nThe past comes to light when second-year students Satoru Gojou and Suguru Getou are tasked with escorting young Riko Amanai to Master Tengen. But when a non-sorcerer user tries to kill them, their mission to protect the Star Plasma Vessel threatens to turn them into bitter enemies and cement their destinies—one as the world’s strongest sorcerer, and the other its most twisted curse user!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","kind":"anime","rating":8.6,"certification":null,"runtime":24},{"id":"cmri0t1owbxklns75wok8cgy0","title":"Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Infinity Castle","subtitle":"2025","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx178788-zm3gtpB9TpRt.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/178788-tSHb5MiaNBNL.jpg","overview":"Part 1 of the theatrical trilogy adaptation of the Infinity Castle Arc.\n\nTanjiro Kamado – a boy who joined an organization dedicated to hunting down demons called the Demon Slayer Corps after his younger sister Nezuko was turned into a demon.\n\nWhile growing stronger and deepening his friendships and bonds with fellow corps members, Tanjiro has battled many demons with his comrades – Zenitsu Agatsuma and Inosuke Hashibira. Along the way, his journey has led him to fight alongside the Demon Slayer Corps’ highest-ranking swordsmen, the Hashira, including Flame Hashira Kyojuro Rengoku aboard the Mugen Train, Sound Hashira Tengen Uzui within the Entertainment District, as well as Mist Hashira Muichiro Tokito and Love Hashira Mitsuri Kanroji at the Swordsmith Village.\n\nAs the Demon Slayer Corps members and Hashira engaged in a group strength training program, the Hashira Training, in preparation for the forthcoming battle against the demons, Muzan Kibutsuji appears at the Ubuyashiki Mansion. With the head of the Demon Corps in danger, Tanjiro and the Hashira rush to the headquarters but are plunged into a deep descent to a mysterious space by the hands of Muzan Kibutsuji.\n\nThe destination of where Tanjiro and Demon Slayer Corps have fallen is the demons’ stronghold – the Infinity Castle. And so, the battleground is set as the final battle between the Demon Slayer Corps and the demons ignites.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","kind":"anime","rating":8.6,"certification":null,"runtime":155},{"id":"cmri0xbqvc2e0ns75w3o4jb7v","title":"The Disappearance of Haruhi Suzumiya","subtitle":"2010","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx7311-9Mfc1YRHwCCW.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/7311-LkdBCThgXouS.jpg","overview":"It is mid-December, and SOS Brigade chief Haruhi Suzumiya announces that the Brigade is going to hold a Christmas party in their clubroom, with Japanese hotpot for dinner. The brigade members Kyon, Yuki Nagato, Mikuru Asahina and Itsuki Koizumi start preparing everything for the party, such as costumes and decorations. But a couple of days later, Kyon arrives at school only to find that Haruhi is missing. Not only that, but Mikuru claims she has never known Kyon before, Koizumi is also missing, and Yuki has become the sole member of the literature club. The SOS Brigade seems to have never existed, nor has Haruhi Suzumiya. No one in the school has ever heard about her... except for Kyon.\n(Source: Anime News Network)","kind":"anime","rating":8.6,"certification":null,"runtime":162},{"id":"cmri1778jceilns75ixlee80l","title":"【OSHI NO KO】Season 3","subtitle":"2026","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182587-fsU8LOjmd7oj.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182587-SLNmuinewbUF.jpg","overview":"The third season of [Oshi no Ko].\n\nThe story enters a new stage.\n\nIt's been six months since \"POP IN 2\" was released. Thanks to MEM-Cho's hard work, B-Komachi is about to get their major break. Aqua is a multi-talented entertainer, and Akane's career as a talented actress is going smoothly. Meanwhile, Kana lost the cheerfulness she once had. To track down the truth behind Ai and Goro's deaths, Ruby keeps rising in the entertainment world...\n\nUsing lies as a weapon.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\nNote: The last episode has an extended runtime of ~54 minutes.","kind":"anime","rating":8.6,"certification":null,"runtime":24},{"id":"cmri18937cfb6ns758khscraj","title":"The Dangers in My Heart Season 2","subtitle":"2024","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx166216-vCMkF4e3x5FB.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/166216-mmAL8hAH8Ttc.jpg","overview":"The second season of Boku no Kokoro no Yabai Yatsu.\n\nAfter an eventful winter break, Kyoutarou Ichikawa and Anna Yamada reunite with a stronger bond. They continue to grow in their own ways, with Yamada taking on more challenging photoshoots and Ichikawa maturing both physically and emotionally as he tackles his affections for Yamada. However, spending time together outside of school allows for their relationship to deepen, and it becomes increasingly difficult to deny their budding romantic feelings.\n\nGrappling with these unexpected and new emotions, Ichikawa and Yamada realize that, with the passage of time, their relationship is bound to change—and they must ultimately decide whether they wish to remain close friends or finally become a couple.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","kind":"anime","rating":8.6,"certification":null,"runtime":23},{"id":"cmri1agzrch5mns75x2kuzzr6","title":"HAIKYU!! The Dumpster Battle","subtitle":"2024","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx153658-KVnjW77cQw3y.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/153658-7MePQPgSHrH1.jpg","overview":"Theatrical follow-up to Haikyuu!! TO THE TOP 2. The first film of Haikyuu!! FINAL.\n\nThe Spring Nationals tournament continues on, with Karasuno High matched against rivals Nekoma High, the fated battle between cats versus crows, also known as the highly anticipated “Dumpster Battle”. This match is the long awaited ultimate showdown between two opposing underdog teams.\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)","kind":"anime","rating":8.6,"certification":null,"runtime":85},{"id":"cmri2zuuqek0yns7513dpou6s","title":"MUSHI-SHI The Next Passage 2","subtitle":"2014","posterUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20751-O3XJ9u30y7Qj.png","backdropUrl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n20751-ipj6JyHGCuol.jpg","overview":"Second season of Mushishi Zoku Shou.\n\nGhostly, primordial beings known as Mushi continue to cause mysterious changes in the lives of humans. The travelling Mushishi, Ginko, persists in trying to set right the strange and unsettling situations he encounters. Time loops, living shadows, and telepathy are among the overt effects of interference from Mushi, but more subtle symptoms that take years to be noticed also rouse Ginko's concern as he passes from village to village.","kind":"anime","rating":8.6,"certification":null,"runtime":24}]}}